      "title": "KAFKA-20983: Keep static member id when LeaveGroup is suppressed",
      "text": "A static consumer that calls unsubscribe suppresses the LeaveGroup RPC, but resetGenerationOnLeaveGroup erased the local member id. The next join carries UNKNOWN_MEMBER_ID while the coordinator still retains the old member.",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/issues/20983",
      "author": "Kafka contributor",
      "occurredAt": "2026-08-24T09:15:00Z",
      "sourceVersion": "github-issue-20983-updated-2026-08-24",
      "tags": ["consumer", "group-coordinator", "static-membership"],
