      "ordinal": 0,
      "title": "Issue 20983: Preserve qualifiers through aggregate rewrites",
      "text": "The optimizer drops a relation qualifier after projection and aggregate rewrites. Column resolution then reports an ambiguous field even though the original qualified reference was valid.",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://github.com/apache/datafusion/issues/20983",
      "author": "DataFusion contributor",
      "occurredAt": "2026-08-23T16:30:00Z",
      "sourceVersion": "github-issue-20983-updated-2026-08-23",
      "tags": ["optimizer", "aggregate", "qualified-column"],
