      "ordinal": 0,
      "title": "KIP-1150: Diskless Topics",
      "text": "Diskless topics write producer batches directly to object storage and register them with the coordinator. This proposal is related to storage cost but is not the KIP-405 tiered-storage work.",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1150%3A+Diskless+Topics",
